  "body": "<h2><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" name=\"project\"></a>Project (Important Dates and Submission Sites)</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Group Forming deadline: 18 Sept 1:30pm&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Proposal deadline: 25 Sept 1:30pm</li>\n<li><span>Project presentation schedule availability indication deadline: 2 Oct 1:30pm</span></li>\n<li>Final report deadline: 13 Nov 1:30pm</li>\n<li>Student Presentation Order Form: <strong>Before</strong> Your Assigned Presentation Time Slot</li>\n<li>PPT/Source Code submission deadline: <strong>Before</strong><span>&nbsp;Your Assigned Presentation Time Slot</span></li>\n<li>Presentation Dates: To be announced after the proposal deadline (where the dates should be just after the final report deadline).&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Declaring Contribution of Each Member Deadline: Last Day of All Presentations (23:59)<br>(All members in the group have to submit this declaration independently)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Submission Sites</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Note: <strong>Only one</strong> member in your group is responsible for the group submission except the declaring contribution of each member where each member needs to submit the form <strong>individually</strong>.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Group Forming Submission (<a title=\"Project Group Forming\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/quizzes/164867\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/quizzes/164867\" data-api-returntype=\"Quiz\">Link</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Proposal Submission (<a title=\"Project Proposal\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/assignments/441792\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/assignments/441792\" data-api-returntype=\"Assignment\">Link</a>)<br></span></li>\n<li><span>Project Presentation Schedule Availability Form (Your Group Availability Collection Form) (<a title=\"Project Presentation Schedule Availability\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/quizzes/164865\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/quizzes/164865\" data-api-returntype=\"Quiz\">Link</a>) (To be opened on 18 Sept after our groups are finalized)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Final Report Submission (<a title=\"Project Final Report Submission\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/assignments/441790\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/assignments/441790\" data-api-returntype=\"Assignment\">Link</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">Student Presentation Order Form Submission (<a title=\"Project Student Presentation Order Form\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/assignments/441793\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/assignments/441793\" data-api-returntype=\"Assignment\">Link</a>)&nbsp;<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\">PPT/Source Code Submission (<a title=\"Project Recorded Video/PPT/Source Code submission\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/assignments/441791\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/assignments/441791\" data-api-returntype=\"Assignment\">Link</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Declaring Contribution of Each Member Site</span> (<a title=\"Project - Declaring Contribution of Each Member\" href=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/courses/72132/quizzes/164866\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://canvas.ust.hk/api/v1/courses/72132/quizzes/164866\" data-api-returntype=\"Quiz\">Link</a>) (Submitted individually)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
